 a  time is called monohybrid cross so  whatever we've learned so far was a  monohybrid cross and the ratio obtained  after the cross is nothing but a  monohybrid ratio how is the dihybrid  cross that is a cross involving two  characters at a time carried out there  and what about the dihybrid ratio let's  get to know that in the next part  [Music]

